  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "François Nuyts is a French e-commerce executive who led Allegro through its stock-market flotation. He previously developed Amazon’s businesses in Spain and Italy after beginning his career at Accenture. Educated at ESLSCA and Babson College, he became a shareholder in Allegro and has also backed the Spanish pharmacy network Luda Partners.",
    "html": "<p>François Nuyts is a French e-commerce executive who led Allegro through its stock-market flotation. He previously developed Amazon’s businesses in Spain and Italy after beginning his career at Accenture. Educated at ESLSCA and Babson College, he became a shareholder in Allegro and has also backed the Spanish pharmacy network Luda Partners.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 51,
